{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-44800","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51491","text":"κ Integration Spec: Product-Level Specification"}]},{"id":"blk-44801","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51492","text":"Version 0.2.0 — Normalized"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44803","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51493","text":"How the cyclicity invariant κ is computed, surfaced, and used across Graphonomous, BendScript, Deliberatic, TickTickClock, and the [&] Protocol.  "},{"id":"spn-51494","marks":["bold"],"text":"v0.2.0 changes (from Codex review):"},{"id":"spn-51495","text":" - Normalized all field names to a single canonical schema (§2.4) - Resolved tool naming: "},{"id":"spn-51496","marks":["code"],"text":"analyze_topology"},{"id":"spn-51497","text":" is the standalone tool; "},{"id":"spn-51498","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve_context"},{"id":"spn-51499","text":" gains a "},{"id":"spn-51500","marks":["code"],"text":"topology"},{"id":"spn-51501","text":" field — no "},{"id":"spn-51502","marks":["code"],"text":"memory_recall_with_topology"},{"id":"spn-51503","text":" tool - Fixed approximation representation: "},{"id":"spn-51504","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa"},{"id":"spn-51505","text":" is always an integer; large SCCs add "},{"id":"spn-51506","marks":["code"],"text":"approximate: true"},{"id":"spn-51507","text":" (no "},{"id":"spn-51508","marks":["code"],"text":"exact"},{"id":"spn-51509","text":" field) - Added instrumentation requirements (§7) - Clarified BendScript directed-edge policy (§4.3)"}]}],"id":"blk-44802","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-44804","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51510","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-44805","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51511","text":"1. Overview"}]},{"id":"blk-44806","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51512","text":"κ (kappa) is a graph-theoretic invariant that measures the minimum irreducible bidirectional information flow in a directed graph. It is the routing primitive that determines whether a query region of a knowledge graph requires single-pass retrieval (κ = 0) or iterative deliberation (κ > 0)."}]},{"id":"blk-44807","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51513","text":"This spec defines:"}]},{"id":"blk-44808","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44810","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51514","text":"How κ is computed"}]}],"id":"blk-44809","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44812","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51515","text":"Where it is computed in the stack"}]}],"id":"blk-44811","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44814","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51516","text":"How it routes inference"}]}],"id":"blk-44813","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44816","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51517","text":"How it is surfaced to users"}]}],"id":"blk-44815","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44818","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51518","text":"How it integrates with each product"}]}],"id":"blk-44817","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44819","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51519","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-44820","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51520","text":"2. Computation"}]},{"id":"blk-44821","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51521","text":"2.1 Algorithm"}]},{"id":"blk-44822","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"function compute_kappa(graph):\n    # Pre-step: define node universe U from the analyzed subgraph/query result.\n    # Ignore any edge where src ∉ U or dst ∉ U.\n    # Exclude self-loops (u -> u) from adjacency for κ computation.\n    # Step 1: Find all strongly connected components\n    sccs = tarjan_scc(graph)                    # O(V + E)\n\n    # Step 2: For each nontrivial SCC (size > 1)\n    results = []\n    for scc in sccs where |scc| > 1:\n        # Step 3: Enumerate bipartitions, find minimum bidirectional cut\n        k = infinity\n        for (A, B) in nontrivial_bipartitions(scc):\n            edges_a_to_b = count_edges(A, B, graph)\n            edges_b_to_a = count_edges(B, A, graph)\n            bidirectional_cut = min(edges_a_to_b, edges_b_to_a)\n            k = min(k, bidirectional_cut)\n            if k == 0: break  # early exit (can't go lower)\n\n        # Step 4: Record SCC with its κ value and minimum-cut partition\n        results.append({\n            scc: scc,\n            kappa: k,\n            min_cut_partition: (A_min, B_min),\n            min_cut_edges: edges_achieving_minimum\n        })\n\n    return results"},{"id":"blk-44823","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51522","text":"2.2 Complexity"}]},{"id":"blk-44824","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44826","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51523","marks":["bold"],"text":"SCC decomposition:"},{"id":"spn-51524","text":" O(V + E) via Tarjan's algorithm"}]}],"id":"blk-44825","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44828","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51525","marks":["bold"],"text":"κ computation per SCC:"},{"id":"spn-51526","text":" O(2^|SCC| × |SCC|²) in the worst case (enumerating all bipartitions)"}]}],"id":"blk-44827","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44830","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51527","marks":["bold"],"text":"Practical constraint:"},{"id":"spn-51528","text":" For SCCs up to ~20 nodes, bipartition enumeration is feasible in real time. For larger SCCs, use approximation:"}]}],"id":"blk-44829","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44832","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51529","text":"Return SCC size as a proxy for κ, with "},{"id":"spn-51530","marks":["code"],"text":"approximate: true"},{"id":"spn-51531","text":" flag"}]}],"id":"blk-44831","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44834","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51532","text":"κ field remains an integer (the estimate), never a symbol/atom/string"}]}],"id":"blk-44833","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44836","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51533","marks":["bold"],"text":"Node-universe rule (NORMATIVE):"},{"id":"spn-51534","text":" Analyze only the node set supplied by retrieval/query scope (or explicit "},{"id":"spn-51535","marks":["code"],"text":"node_ids"},{"id":"spn-51536","text":" input). Do not pull in external nodes implicitly during κ analysis."}]}],"id":"blk-44835","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44838","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51537","marks":["bold"],"text":"Self-loop rule (NORMATIVE):"},{"id":"spn-51538","text":" Exclude self-loops ("},{"id":"spn-51539","marks":["code"],"text":"source == target"},{"id":"spn-51540","text":") from κ adjacency and cut counts."}]}],"id":"blk-44837","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44839","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51541","text":"2.3 Incremental Updates"}]},{"id":"blk-44840","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51542","text":"When an edge is added or removed from the knowledge graph:"}]},{"id":"blk-44841","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51543","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-51544","marks":["bold"],"text":"Edge addition:"},{"id":"spn-51545","text":" Can only merge SCCs or enlarge existing ones. Re-run Tarjan on the affected component. If a new nontrivial SCC is formed, compute κ for it. 2. "},{"id":"spn-51546","marks":["bold"],"text":"Edge removal:"},{"id":"spn-51547","text":" Can only split SCCs or shrink them. Re-run Tarjan on the affected component. Recompute κ for any remaining nontrivial SCCs. 3. "},{"id":"spn-51548","marks":["bold"],"text":"Optimization:"},{"id":"spn-51549","text":" Maintain an SCC index alongside the knowledge graph. Incremental SCC algorithms (e.g., Bender, Fineman & Gilbert 2015) can update SCCs in O(V) amortized per edge change."}]},{"id":"blk-44842","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51550","text":"2.4 Canonical Schema (NORMATIVE — all implementations must match)"}]},{"id":"blk-44843","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51551","text":"Every κ topology result — whether from Elixir, JavaScript, or MCP JSON — uses these exact field names:"}]},{"id":"blk-44844","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"sccs\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"scc-0\",\n      \"nodes\": [\"node-a\", \"node-b\"],\n      \"kappa\": 2,\n      \"approximate\": false,\n      \"fault_line_edges\": [\n        {\"source\": \"node-a\", \"target\": \"node-b\"}\n      ],\n      \"routing\": \"deliberate\",\n      \"deliberation_budget\": {\n        \"max_iterations\": 3,\n        \"agent_count\": 2,\n        \"timeout_multiplier\": 2.0,\n        \"confidence_threshold\": 0.80\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"dag_nodes\": [\"node-x\", \"node-y\"],\n  \"routing\": \"deliberate\",\n  \"max_kappa\": 2,\n  \"scc_count\": 1\n}"},{"id":"blk-44845","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51552","marks":["bold"],"text":"Field name rules (resolves all drift):"}]},{"id":"blk-44846","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44848","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51553","text":"Top-level routing key: "},{"id":"spn-51554","marks":["code"],"text":"routing"},{"id":"spn-51555","text":" (not "},{"id":"spn-51556","marks":["code"],"text":"overall_routing"},{"id":"spn-51557","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-44847","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44850","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51558","text":"Edge endpoints: "},{"id":"spn-51559","marks":["code"],"text":"source"},{"id":"spn-51560","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-51561","marks":["code"],"text":"target"},{"id":"spn-51562","text":" (not "},{"id":"spn-51563","marks":["code"],"text":"from"},{"id":"spn-51564","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-51565","marks":["code"],"text":"to"},{"id":"spn-51566","text":", not "},{"id":"spn-51567","marks":["code"],"text":"a"},{"id":"spn-51568","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-51569","marks":["code"],"text":"b"},{"id":"spn-51570","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-44849","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44852","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51571","text":"Fault lines: "},{"id":"spn-51572","marks":["code"],"text":"fault_line_edges"},{"id":"spn-51573","text":" (not "},{"id":"spn-51574","marks":["code"],"text":"min_cut_edges"},{"id":"spn-51575","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-44851","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44854","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51576","text":"κ type: always "},{"id":"spn-51577","marks":["code"],"text":"integer"},{"id":"spn-51578","text":" (never string, atom, or symbol)"}]}],"id":"blk-44853","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44856","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51579","text":"Approximation: "},{"id":"spn-51580","marks":["code"],"text":"\"approximate\": true"},{"id":"spn-51581","text":" boolean flag on the SCC object; "},{"id":"spn-51582","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa"},{"id":"spn-51583","text":" still holds the integer estimate"}]}],"id":"blk-44855","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44858","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51584","text":"Routing values: "},{"id":"spn-51585","marks":["code"],"text":"\"fast\""},{"id":"spn-51586","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-51587","marks":["code"],"text":"\"deliberate\""},{"id":"spn-51588","text":" (strings in JSON, atoms "},{"id":"spn-51589","marks":["code"],"text":":fast"},{"id":"spn-51590","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-51591","marks":["code"],"text":":deliberate"},{"id":"spn-51592","text":" in Elixir, strings in JS)"}]}],"id":"blk-44857","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44859","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51593","marks":["bold"],"text":"Schema boundary rules (NORMATIVE):"}]},{"id":"blk-44860","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44862","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51594","marks":["bold"],"text":"On MCP/JSON boundaries:"},{"id":"spn-51595","text":" use canonical snake_case keys exactly as defined in §2.4 ("},{"id":"spn-51596","marks":["code"],"text":"fault_line_edges"},{"id":"spn-51597","text":", "},{"id":"spn-51598","marks":["code"],"text":"max_kappa"},{"id":"spn-51599","text":", "},{"id":"spn-51600","marks":["code"],"text":"scc_count"},{"id":"spn-51601","text":", etc.)."}]}],"id":"blk-44861","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44864","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51602","marks":["bold"],"text":"Inside Elixir runtime:"},{"id":"spn-51603","text":" atoms are allowed for routing values ("},{"id":"spn-51604","marks":["code"],"text":":fast"},{"id":"spn-51605","text":", "},{"id":"spn-51606","marks":["code"],"text":":deliberate"},{"id":"spn-51607","text":"), but keys remain canonical and are serialized to JSON strings at the boundary."}]}],"id":"blk-44863","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44866","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51608","marks":["bold"],"text":"Inside JavaScript UI code:"},{"id":"spn-51609","text":" camelCase mirrors are allowed for local-only objects ("},{"id":"spn-51610","marks":["code"],"text":"faultLineEdges"},{"id":"spn-51611","text":", "},{"id":"spn-51612","marks":["code"],"text":"maxKappa"},{"id":"spn-51613","text":", "},{"id":"spn-51614","marks":["code"],"text":"sccCount"},{"id":"spn-51615","text":") for ergonomics, but any network payload or persisted topology record must be converted back to canonical snake_case."}]}],"id":"blk-44865","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44867","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51616","marks":["bold"],"text":"Elixir atom mapping:"}]},{"id":"blk-44868","kind":"code","language":"elixir","text":"# Elixir uses atoms internally, converts to strings for MCP JSON\n:fast       → \"fast\"\n:deliberate → \"deliberate\""},{"id":"blk-44869","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51617","marks":["bold"],"text":"JavaScript mapping (local only):"}]},{"id":"blk-44870","kind":"code","language":"javascript","text":"// Local object ergonomics\n{ faultLineEdges, maxKappa, sccCount, routing }\n\n// MCP / wire payloads must remain canonical snake_case\n{ fault_line_edges, max_kappa, scc_count, routing }"},{"id":"blk-44871","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51618","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-44872","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51619","text":"3. Routing Logic"}]},{"id":"blk-44873","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51620","text":"3.1 The κ Router"}]},{"id":"blk-44874","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51621","text":"The κ router sits between memory retrieval and reasoning. It inspects the topological structure of the retrieved subgraph and makes a routing decision."}]},{"id":"blk-44875","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"function kappa_route(retrieved_subgraph):\n    scc_analysis = compute_kappa(retrieved_subgraph)\n\n    dag_context = nodes NOT in any nontrivial SCC\n    scc_contexts = scc_analysis  # list of {scc, kappa, fault_line_edges, ...}\n\n    # DAG regions: single-pass retrieval\n    retrieval_context = topological_sort_and_collect(dag_context)\n\n    # SCC regions: flag for deliberation\n    deliberation_tasks = []\n    for scc_info in scc_contexts:\n        deliberation_tasks.append({\n            nodes: scc_info.scc,\n            kappa: scc_info.kappa,\n            fault_lines: scc_info.fault_line_edges,\n            budget: deliberation_budget(scc_info.kappa)\n        })\n\n    return {\n        retrieval_context: retrieval_context,\n        deliberation_tasks: deliberation_tasks,\n        routing: \"fast\" if len(deliberation_tasks) == 0 else \"deliberate\"\n    }"},{"id":"blk-44876","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51622","text":"3.2 Deliberation Budget Function"}]},{"id":"blk-44877","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51623","text":"The deliberation budget maps κ to concrete inference parameters. This is an engineering heuristic (not proved — to be tuned empirically). Caps on "},{"id":"spn-51624","marks":["code"],"text":"max_iterations"},{"id":"spn-51625","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-51626","marks":["code"],"text":"confidence_threshold"},{"id":"spn-51627","text":" are required to prevent runaway values when "},{"id":"spn-51628","marks":["code"],"text":"approximate: true"},{"id":"spn-51629","text":" SCCs use size-based κ estimates:"}]},{"id":"blk-44878","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"function deliberation_budget(kappa):\n    return {\n        max_iterations: min(kappa + 1, 4),\n        agent_count: min(kappa, 3),\n        timeout_multiplier: min(1.0 + 0.5*kappa, 3.5),\n        confidence_threshold: min(0.7 + 0.05*kappa, 0.95)\n    }"},{"id":"blk-44879","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51630","text":"3.3 The Fast Path vs. Deliberation Path"}]},{"id":"blk-44880","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"             ┌─────────────────┐\n             │  Query arrives   │\n             └────────┬────────┘\n                      │\n                      ▼\n             ┌─────────────────┐\n             │  &memory.recall  │   Graphonomous retrieves relevant subgraph\n             └────────┬────────┘\n                      │\n                      ▼\n             ┌─────────────────┐\n             │  κ Router        │   Compute SCCs, κ values\n             └────────┬────────┘\n                      │\n              ┌───────┴────────┐\n              │                │\n         κ = 0 (all DAG)    κ > 0 (has SCCs)\n              │                │\n              ▼                ▼\n       ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────────┐\n       │ Fast Path │    │  Deliberation │\n       │ single    │    │  &reason via  │\n       │ pass      │    │  Deliberatic  │\n       │ retrieval │    │  κ-informed   │\n       └─────┬────┘    │  budget       │\n             │         └──────┬───────┘\n             │                │\n             └───────┬────────┘\n                     │\n                     ▼\n             ┌──────────────┐\n             │  &memory.learn │   Results feed back into graph\n             └──────────────┘"},{"id":"blk-44881","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51631","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-44882","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51632","text":"4. Product Integration"}]},{"id":"blk-44883","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51633","text":"4.1 Graphonomous"}]},{"id":"blk-44884","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51634","marks":["bold"],"text":"Where κ lives:"},{"id":"spn-51635","text":" Computed at query time on the retrieved subgraph. Cached per SCC in the knowledge graph index; invalidated on edge changes."}]},{"id":"blk-44885","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51636","marks":["bold"],"text":"What changes:"}]},{"id":"blk-44886","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44888","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51637","marks":["code"],"text":"Retriever.retrieve/2"},{"id":"spn-51638","text":" now returns a "},{"id":"spn-51639","marks":["code"],"text":"topology"},{"id":"spn-51640","text":" key alongside existing "},{"id":"spn-51641","marks":["code"],"text":"results"},{"id":"spn-51642","text":", "},{"id":"spn-51643","marks":["code"],"text":"causal_context"},{"id":"spn-51644","text":", "},{"id":"spn-51645","marks":["code"],"text":"stats"}]}],"id":"blk-44887","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44890","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51646","text":"New module "},{"id":"spn-51647","marks":["code"],"text":"Graphonomous.Topology"},{"id":"spn-51648","text":" computes and returns the full SCC analysis for a given subgraph"}]}],"id":"blk-44889","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44892","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51649","text":"New function "},{"id":"spn-51650","marks":["code"],"text":"Store.list_edges_between/1"},{"id":"spn-51651","text":" fetches edges within a node set"}]}],"id":"blk-44891","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44893","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51652","marks":["bold"],"text":"MCP tool: `analyze_topology` (NEW standalone tool):"}]},{"id":"blk-44894","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"name\": \"analyze_topology\",\n  \"description\": \"Compute topological structure (SCCs, κ values, routing decision) for a set of nodes in the knowledge graph.\",\n  \"inputSchema\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"node_ids\": {\n        \"type\": \"array\",\n        \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"description\": \"Node IDs to analyze. If omitted, analyzes the full graph.\"\n      },\n      \"query\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"description\": \"Optional query text. If provided, retrieves relevant nodes first, then analyzes their topology.\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-44895","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51653","marks":["bold"],"text":"MCP tool: `retrieve_context` (EXISTING — augmented with topology):"}]},{"id":"blk-44896","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51654","text":"The existing "},{"id":"spn-51655","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve_context"},{"id":"spn-51656","text":" tool gains a "},{"id":"spn-51657","marks":["code"],"text":"topology"},{"id":"spn-51658","text":" field in its response. No new tool name — same endpoint, richer response:"}]},{"id":"blk-44897","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"query\": \"company strategy\",\n  \"count\": 7,\n  \"results\": [\"...existing results...\"],\n  \"causal_context\": [\"...existing...\"],\n  \"stats\": {\"...existing...\"},\n  \"topology\": {\n    \"sccs\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"scc-0\",\n        \"nodes\": [\"market-share\", \"revenue\", \"r-and-d\", \"product-quality\", \"customer-retention\"],\n        \"kappa\": 1,\n        \"approximate\": false,\n        \"fault_line_edges\": [\n          {\"source\": \"product-quality\", \"target\": \"market-share\"}\n        ],\n        \"routing\": \"deliberate\",\n        \"deliberation_budget\": {\n          \"max_iterations\": 2,\n          \"agent_count\": 1,\n          \"timeout_multiplier\": 1.5,\n          \"confidence_threshold\": 0.75\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"dag_nodes\": [\"founding-date\", \"ceo-name\", \"headquarters\"],\n    \"routing\": \"deliberate\",\n    \"max_kappa\": 1,\n    \"scc_count\": 1\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-44898","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51659","text":"4.2 Deliberatic"}]},{"id":"blk-44899","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51660","marks":["bold"],"text":"What changes:"}]},{"id":"blk-44900","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44902","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51661","text":"Accepts "},{"id":"spn-51662","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa"},{"id":"spn-51663","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-51664","marks":["code"],"text":"fault_line_edges"},{"id":"spn-51665","text":" as input parameters on its deliberation endpoint."}]}],"id":"blk-44901","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44904","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51666","text":"Uses "},{"id":"spn-51667","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa"},{"id":"spn-51668","text":" to set argumentation depth (number of rounds)."}]}],"id":"blk-44903","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44906","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51669","text":"Uses "},{"id":"spn-51670","marks":["code"],"text":"fault_line_edges"},{"id":"spn-51671","text":" (minimum-cut edges) to generate the initial propositions that agents must argue about — these are the critical bidirectional dependencies."}]}],"id":"blk-44905","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44907","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51672","marks":["bold"],"text":"MCP tool additions:"}]},{"id":"blk-44908","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"name\": \"deliberate_on_scc\",\n  \"description\": \"Run structured argumentation on a strongly connected knowledge cluster. Uses κ to set deliberation budget and fault lines to seed propositions.\",\n  \"inputSchema\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"scc_nodes\": { \"type\": \"array\", \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" } },\n      \"scc_edges\": { \"type\": \"array\" },\n      \"kappa\": { \"type\": \"integer\" },\n      \"fault_line_edges\": { \"type\": \"array\" },\n      \"governance\": { \"type\": \"object\" }\n    }\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-44909","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51673","marks":["bold"],"text":"Key insight:"},{"id":"spn-51674","text":" Deliberatic doesn't need to know about graph theory. It receives a set of propositions (derived from fault lines), a budget (derived from κ), and it argues. The graph intelligence lives in Graphonomous; the argumentation intelligence lives in Deliberatic. κ is the handshake between them."}]},{"id":"blk-44910","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51675","text":"4.3 BendScript"}]},{"id":"blk-44911","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51676","marks":["bold"],"text":"What changes:"}]},{"id":"blk-44912","kind":"heading","level":4,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51677","text":"Directed-Edge Policy (NORMATIVE)"}]},{"id":"blk-44913","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51678","text":"BendScript edges have a "},{"id":"spn-51679","marks":["code"],"text":"kind"},{"id":"spn-51680","text":" property. For κ computation, edge directionality is determined by kind:"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-44915","spans":[{"id":"spn-51681","text":"Edge kind"}]},{"id":"blk-44916","spans":[{"id":"spn-51682","text":"Directionality for κ"}]},{"id":"blk-44917","spans":[{"id":"spn-51683","text":"Rationale"}]}],"id":"blk-44914","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-44918","spans":[{"id":"spn-51684","marks":["code"],"text":"causal"}]},{"id":"blk-44919","spans":[{"id":"spn-51685","marks":["bold"],"text":"Directed"},{"id":"spn-51686","text":" (a → b)"}]},{"id":"blk-44920","spans":[{"id":"spn-51687","text":"Cause precedes effect"}]}],[{"id":"blk-44921","spans":[{"id":"spn-51688","marks":["code"],"text":"temporal"}]},{"id":"blk-44922","spans":[{"id":"spn-51689","marks":["bold"],"text":"Directed"},{"id":"spn-51690","text":" (a → b)"}]},{"id":"blk-44923","spans":[{"id":"spn-51691","text":"Before precedes after"}]}],[{"id":"blk-44924","spans":[{"id":"spn-51692","marks":["code"],"text":"context"}]},{"id":"blk-44925","spans":[{"id":"spn-51693","marks":["bold"],"text":"Skip"},{"id":"spn-51694","text":" (excluded from κ graph)"}]},{"id":"blk-44926","spans":[{"id":"spn-51695","text":"Symmetric, no feedback"}]}],[{"id":"blk-44927","spans":[{"id":"spn-51696","marks":["code"],"text":"associative"}]},{"id":"blk-44928","spans":[{"id":"spn-51697","marks":["bold"],"text":"Skip"},{"id":"spn-51698","text":" (excluded from κ graph)"}]},{"id":"blk-44929","spans":[{"id":"spn-51699","text":"Symmetric, no feedback"}]}],[{"id":"blk-44930","spans":[{"id":"spn-51700","marks":["code"],"text":"user"}]},{"id":"blk-44931","spans":[{"id":"spn-51701","marks":["bold"],"text":"Skip"},{"id":"spn-51702","text":" (excluded from κ graph)"}]},{"id":"blk-44932","spans":[{"id":"spn-51703","text":"Ambiguous directionality"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-44933","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51704","text":"This is a "},{"id":"spn-51705","marks":["bold"],"text":"hard rule"},{"id":"spn-51706","text":", not a toggle. Only "},{"id":"spn-51707","marks":["code"],"text":"causal"},{"id":"spn-51708","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-51709","marks":["code"],"text":"temporal"},{"id":"spn-51710","text":" edges participate in SCC/κ computation. The filter constant:"}]},{"id":"blk-44934","kind":"code","language":"javascript","text":"const DIRECTED_KINDS = ['causal', 'temporal'];"},{"id":"blk-44935","kind":"heading","level":4,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51711","text":"Visual Layer"}]},{"id":"blk-44936","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44938","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51712","marks":["bold"],"text":"SCC clusters rendered visually:"},{"id":"spn-51713","text":" Nodes within a nontrivial SCC share a colored halo or background region. Color intensity scales with κ."}]}],"id":"blk-44937","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44940","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51714","marks":["bold"],"text":"Minimum-cut edges highlighted:"},{"id":"spn-51715","text":" Fault-line edges rendered in dashed style ("},{"id":"spn-51716","marks":["code"],"text":"ctx.setLineDash([6, 4])"},{"id":"spn-51717","text":") with brighter color."}]}],"id":"blk-44939","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44942","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51718","marks":["bold"],"text":"κ badge on SCC clusters:"},{"id":"spn-51719","text":" Each SCC cluster shows its κ value as a small badge, e.g., \"κ=2\"."}]}],"id":"blk-44941","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44943","kind":"heading","level":4,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51720","text":"Interaction Layer"}]},{"id":"blk-44944","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44946","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51721","marks":["bold"],"text":"Topology preview via context menu:"},{"id":"spn-51722","text":" When the user right-clicks a node and selects \"Connect to…\" (a new context menu item), BendScript shows candidate target nodes with topology impact annotations:"}]}],"id":"blk-44945","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44948","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51723","text":"\"→ NodeX: creates feedback loop (κ: 0→1)\""}]}],"id":"blk-44947","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44950","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51724","text":"\"→ NodeY: strengthens loop (κ: 1→2)\""}]}],"id":"blk-44949","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44952","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51725","text":"\"→ NodeZ: no topological change\""}]}],"id":"blk-44951","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44954","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51726","marks":["bold"],"text":"\"Bend\" action:"},{"id":"spn-51727","text":" Right-click context menu on DAG nodes — automatically suggests the nearest edge that would create a feedback loop."}]}],"id":"blk-44953","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44956","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51728","marks":["bold"],"text":"\"Unbend\" action:"},{"id":"spn-51729","text":" Right-click context menu on SCC nodes — identifies the fault-line edge and offers to remove it."}]}],"id":"blk-44955","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44957","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51730","marks":["bold"],"text":"Note:"},{"id":"spn-51731","text":" BendScript does NOT currently have drag-to-connect edge creation. The topology preview is accessed via the context menu \"Connect to…\" flow. Do not implement drag-to-connect in this phase."}]},{"id":"blk-44958","kind":"heading","level":4,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51732","text":"HUD"}]},{"id":"blk-44959","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44961","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51733","marks":["bold"],"text":"Global κ display:"},{"id":"spn-51734","text":" The existing HUD gains a κ readout showing the maximum κ across all SCCs in the graph, and a count of SCCs."}]}],"id":"blk-44960","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44963","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51735","marks":["bold"],"text":"Routing indicator:"},{"id":"spn-51736","text":" \"mode: RETRIEVAL\" (all κ = 0) or \"mode: DELIBERATION\" (any κ > 0)."}]}],"id":"blk-44962","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44964","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51737","text":"4.4 The [&] Protocol"}]},{"id":"blk-44965","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51738","marks":["bold"],"text":"Grammar extension:"}]},{"id":"blk-44966","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"# Extended [&] capability grammar — topology-aware routing\nTopologyOp      := \"&topology\" \".\" (\"analyze\" | \"route\" | \"kappa\")\n\n# Updated pipeline pattern\nInferencePipeline :=\n    \"&memory.recall\" \"(\" QueryExpr \")\"\n    \"|>\" \"&topology.analyze\" \"()\"\n    \"|>\" \"&topology.route\" \"()\"\n    \"|>\" \"&reason.deliberate\" \"(\" \"budget:\" \":κ\" \")\"\n    \"|>\" \"&memory.learn\" \"()\""},{"id":"blk-44967","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51739","marks":["bold"],"text":"Schema extension (ampersand.schema.json):"}]},{"id":"blk-44968","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"capabilities\": {\n    \"&topology.analyze\": {\n      \"provider\": \"graphonomous\",\n      \"description\": \"Compute SCC decomposition and κ values for a subgraph\",\n      \"config\": {\n        \"max_scc_size_for_exact\": 20,\n        \"approximation_strategy\": \"scc_size_proxy\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"&topology.route\": {\n      \"provider\": \"builtin\",\n      \"description\": \"Route inference based on κ: DAG regions → fast path, SCC regions → deliberation\",\n      \"config\": {\n        \"deliberation_provider\": \"deliberatic\",\n        \"fast_path_provider\": \"graphonomous\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-44969","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51740","text":"4.5 TickTickClock"}]},{"id":"blk-44970","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51741","marks":["bold"],"text":"Connection:"},{"id":"spn-51742","text":" For discrete time-series dynamics, the transition graph of the system has κ > 0 if and only if the system has a periodic orbit. TickTickClock can use this as a formal periodicity detector:"}]},{"id":"blk-44971","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44973","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51743","text":"Discretize time-series data into state transitions"}]}],"id":"blk-44972","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44975","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51744","text":"Build the transition graph"}]}],"id":"blk-44974","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44977","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51745","text":"Compute κ"}]}],"id":"blk-44976","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44979","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51746","text":"κ > 0 → periodic pattern detected, flag for temporal reasoning"}]}],"id":"blk-44978","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44981","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51747","text":"κ = 0 → pure drift, no recurrence"}]}],"id":"blk-44980","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44982","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51748","text":"This is a secondary integration (TickTickClock already has Mamba SSM for pattern detection), but it provides a complementary structural signal."}]},{"id":"blk-44983","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51749","text":"4.6 OpenSentience"}]},{"id":"blk-44984","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51750","marks":["bold"],"text":"Role:"},{"id":"spn-51751","text":" Research home for the theoretical foundations. Hosts:"}]},{"id":"blk-44985","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44987","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51752","text":"The κ paper (theoretical background, proofs, categorical framework)"}]}],"id":"blk-44986","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44989","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51753","text":"The proof code (runnable verification)"}]}],"id":"blk-44988","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44991","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51754","text":"Interactive demos (live κ computation on user-constructed graphs)"}]}],"id":"blk-44990","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44993","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51755","text":"The original Scale Topology Axis essay (broader theoretical context connecting κ to physics, cosmology, and consciousness science)"}]}],"id":"blk-44992","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44994","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51756","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-44995","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51757","text":"5. Implementation Priority"}]},{"id":"blk-44996","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51758","text":"Phase 1: Core (ship first)"}]},{"id":"blk-44997","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44999","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51759","text":"[ ] Port κ computation to Elixir (Graphonomous server-side)"}]}],"id":"blk-44998","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45001","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51760","text":"[ ] Port κ computation to JavaScript (BendScript client-side)"}]}],"id":"blk-45000","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45003","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51761","text":"[ ] Integrate Tarjan's SCC into Graphonomous's graph index"}]}],"id":"blk-45002","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45005","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51762","text":"[ ] Return topology annotations from "},{"id":"spn-51763","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve_context"}]}],"id":"blk-45004","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45007","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51764","text":"[ ] Add SCC visualization to BendScript canvas"}]}],"id":"blk-45006","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45008","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51765","text":"Phase 2: Routing (ship second)"}]},{"id":"blk-45009","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45011","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51766","text":"[ ] Implement κ router in the [&] pipeline"}]}],"id":"blk-45010","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45013","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51767","text":"[ ] Connect κ router to Deliberatic trigger"}]}],"id":"blk-45012","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45015","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51768","text":"[ ] Add deliberation budget function"}]}],"id":"blk-45014","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45017","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51769","text":"[ ] Test on real knowledge graph queries: does κ-aware routing improve answer quality?"}]}],"id":"blk-45016","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45018","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51770","text":"Phase 3: Polish (ship third)"}]},{"id":"blk-45019","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45021","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51771","text":"[ ] BendScript topology preview via context menu"}]}],"id":"blk-45020","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45023","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51772","text":"[ ] Bend/Unbend context menu actions"}]}],"id":"blk-45022","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45025","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51773","text":"[ ] HUD κ display and routing indicator"}]}],"id":"blk-45024","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45027","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51774","text":"[ ] TickTickClock periodicity detection via κ"}]}],"id":"blk-45026","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45029","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51775","text":"[ ] OpenSentience publication of κ paper and demos"}]}],"id":"blk-45028","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45030","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51776","text":"Phase 4: Optimization"}]},{"id":"blk-45031","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45033","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51777","text":"[ ] Incremental SCC maintenance (avoid full recomputation on every edge change)"}]}],"id":"blk-45032","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45035","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51778","text":"[ ] Approximate κ for large SCCs (> 20 nodes)"}]}],"id":"blk-45034","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45037","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51779","text":"[ ] Benchmark: latency impact of topology computation on query path"}]}],"id":"blk-45036","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45039","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51780","text":"[ ] A/B test: κ-routed inference vs. uniform retrieval on quality metrics"}]}],"id":"blk-45038","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45040","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51781","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-45041","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51782","text":"6. Success Metrics"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-45043","spans":[{"id":"spn-51783","text":"Metric"}]},{"id":"blk-45044","spans":[{"id":"spn-51784","text":"Baseline (no κ)"}]},{"id":"blk-45045","spans":[{"id":"spn-51785","text":"Target (with κ)"}]},{"id":"blk-45046","spans":[{"id":"spn-51786","text":"How to Measure"}]}],"id":"blk-45042","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-45047","spans":[{"id":"spn-51787","text":"Answer coherence on circular topics"}]},{"id":"blk-45048","spans":[{"id":"spn-51788","text":"Human eval ~60%"}]},{"id":"blk-45049","spans":[{"id":"spn-51789","text":"Human eval ~80%"}]},{"id":"blk-45050","spans":[{"id":"spn-51790","text":"Blind eval on queries touching SCCs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-45051","spans":[{"id":"spn-51791","text":"Unnecessary deliberation calls"}]},{"id":"blk-45052","spans":[{"id":"spn-51792","text":"N/A (no routing)"}]},{"id":"blk-45053","spans":[{"id":"spn-51793","text":"< 20% of queries"}]},{"id":"blk-45054","spans":[{"id":"spn-51794","text":"Track κ=0 queries that hit deliberation anyway"}]}],[{"id":"blk-45055","spans":[{"id":"spn-51795","text":"Deliberation convergence speed"}]},{"id":"blk-45056","spans":[{"id":"spn-51796","text":"Fixed rounds"}]},{"id":"blk-45057","spans":[{"id":"spn-51797","text":"κ+1 rounds avg"}]},{"id":"blk-45058","spans":[{"id":"spn-51798","text":"Measure rounds to convergence"}]}],[{"id":"blk-45059","spans":[{"id":"spn-51799","text":"User engagement in BendScript"}]},{"id":"blk-45060","spans":[{"id":"spn-51800","text":"Nodes/edges per session"}]},{"id":"blk-45061","spans":[{"id":"spn-51801","text":"+30%"}]},{"id":"blk-45062","spans":[{"id":"spn-51802","text":"Track topology actions (bend/unbend/stargate)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-45063","spans":[{"id":"spn-51803","text":"OpenSentience traffic"}]},{"id":"blk-45064","spans":[{"id":"spn-51804","text":"Baseline"}]},{"id":"blk-45065","spans":[{"id":"spn-51805","text":"Organic from dev community"}]},{"id":"blk-45066","spans":[{"id":"spn-51806","text":"Track referrals from product UIs"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-45067","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51807","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-45068","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51808","text":"7. Instrumentation Requirements (NEW in v0.2.0)"}]},{"id":"blk-45069","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51809","text":"All κ computation must emit telemetry. This is required for Gate C (performance) and Gate D (product effect) validation."}]},{"id":"blk-45070","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51810","text":"7.1 Latency Counters (Elixir — "},{"id":"spn-51811","marks":["code"],"text":":telemetry"},{"id":"spn-51812","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-45071","kind":"code","language":"elixir","text":"# Emit on every topology computation\n# REQUIRED UNIT: duration_ms (float milliseconds)\n# If measured via :timer.tc/1, convert with: duration_ms = duration_us / 1000.0\n:telemetry.execute(\n  [:graphonomous, :topology, :analyze],\n  %{duration_ms: elapsed_ms, node_count: n, edge_count: e},\n  %{scc_count: scc_count, max_kappa: max_kappa, routing: routing}\n)"},{"id":"blk-45072","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51813","text":"Track:"}]},{"id":"blk-45073","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45075","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51814","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.analyze.duration_ms"},{"id":"spn-51815","text":" — p50, p95, p99 (canonical latency metric)"}]}],"id":"blk-45074","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45077","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51816","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.analyze.node_count"},{"id":"spn-51817","text":" — distribution of subgraph sizes"}]}],"id":"blk-45076","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45079","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51818","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.analyze.edge_count"},{"id":"spn-51819","text":" — distribution of subgraph densities"}]}],"id":"blk-45078","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45081","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51820","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.analyze.scc_count"},{"id":"spn-51821","text":" — how often SCCs are found"}]}],"id":"blk-45080","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45083","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51822","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.analyze.routing.deliberate_ratio"},{"id":"spn-51823","text":" — deliberate / total analyzes"}]}],"id":"blk-45082","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45085","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51824","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.analyze.self_loop_filtered_count"},{"id":"spn-51825","text":" — number of self-loops ignored during adjacency construction"}]}],"id":"blk-45084","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45086","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51826","text":"7.2 Routing Decision Counters"}]},{"id":"blk-45087","kind":"code","language":"elixir","text":":telemetry.execute(\n  [:graphonomous, :topology, :route],\n  %{},\n  %{decision: :fast | :deliberate, max_kappa: max_kappa, trigger: :retrieve_context | :analyze_topology}\n)"},{"id":"blk-45088","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51827","text":"Track:"}]},{"id":"blk-45089","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45091","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51828","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.route.fast_count"},{"id":"spn-51829","text":" — queries routed to fast path"}]}],"id":"blk-45090","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45093","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51830","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.route.deliberate_count"},{"id":"spn-51831","text":" — queries routed to deliberation"}]}],"id":"blk-45092","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45095","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51832","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.route.deliberate_ratio"},{"id":"spn-51833","text":" — deliberate / total (target: < 30% on typical workloads)"}]}],"id":"blk-45094","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45096","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51834","text":"7.3 BendScript Performance (JavaScript — "},{"id":"spn-51835","marks":["code"],"text":"performance.now()"},{"id":"spn-51836","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-45097","kind":"code","language":"javascript","text":"const t0 = performance.now();\nconst topo = analyzeTopology(plane);\nconst elapsed = performance.now() - t0;\nconsole.debug(`[κ] topology: ${elapsed.toFixed(1)}ms, maxκ=${topo.maxKappa}, sccs=${topo.sccCount}`);"},{"id":"blk-45098","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51837","text":"Target: < 50ms at 100 nodes."}]},{"id":"blk-45099","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51838","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-45100","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51839","text":"*Spec version: 0.2.0. Status: Draft (normalized). Depends on: kappa_reference.py (computation), kappa_theory_applied.md (theoretical foundations). Products affected: Graphonomous, Deliberatic, BendScript, [&] Protocol, TickTickClock, OpenSentience.*"}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierautdurdtis2o4ddkdicyowzklta73tzxmnkrsnctasiwtfehrvj2q","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}